# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5
# Each coupling and each work of the barostat in a Python simulation
# (D[python-barostat], #275) against `mdir run` of the same control
# on the CPU, in double precision in the deterministic mode:
# the dipeptide in water (1,168 particles, PME, SHAKE and SETTLE) in its
# orthorhombic cell, 40 steps with stochastic cell
# rescaling every 10 at 2000 atm. For the isotropic, the semi-isotropic,
# and the anisotropic coupling with the work of Trotter type, its
# first-order form, and the exact work, and for the isotropic coupling with
# the first-order work: the positions, the velocities, the forces, and the
# cell to the bit, the energy file and the DCD trajectory byte for byte,
# in parts, from a checkpoint of `mdir run`, and into `mdir run
# --continue`; the axes move as the coupling says.
# With a coupling period of 1 the exact and the first-order work scale the
# cell at every step, to the bits of `mdir run`; so do a compressibility of
# each axis, and that of z with a surface tension.
# Inputs/python_barostat.py.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_barostat.py %S/Inputs CPU Double mdir %t orthorhombic | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_barostat.py %S/Inputs CPU Double mdir %t/every-step every-step | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=EVERY
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_barostat.py %S/Inputs CPU Double mdir %t/keys keys | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=KEYS
# CHECK: CPU Double orthorhombic ISOTROPIC TROTTER: a continuation with another coupling or work is refused by both front ends
# CHECK: CPU Double orthorhombic ISOTROPIC TROTTER: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double orthorhombic ISOTROPIC TROTTER_FIRST_ORDER: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double orthorhombic ISOTROPIC EXACT: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double orthorhombic ISOTROPIC FIRST_ORDER: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double orthorhombic SEMI_ISOTROPIC TROTTER: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double orthorhombic SEMI_ISOTROPIC TROTTER_FIRST_ORDER: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double orthorhombic SEMI_ISOTROPIC EXACT: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double orthorhombic ANISOTROPIC TROTTER: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double orthorhombic ANISOTROPIC TROTTER_FIRST_ORDER: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: CPU Double orthorhombic ANISOTROPIC EXACT: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: barostat orthorhombic CPU Double: 10 cases passed
# EVERY: barostat every-step CPU Double: 4 cases passed
# KEYS: barostat keys CPU Double: 4 cases passed
